  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2I26sAXefmk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paulevsGitch/BCLib/main/bclib_banner.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kYuATbYbKW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111370.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterNether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/25/25231.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fquiqueck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.buymeacoffee.com/buttons/v2/default-yellow.png\" alt=\"Buy Me A Coffee\" width=\"217\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>资源包:</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/lum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/285/959/64/64/637302740668770668.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/legendary-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/404/869/64/64/637616146827524233.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>重要提示:</strong></span></p><p>使用此模组的<strong>5.3或更高版本</strong>创建的世界与旧版本不兼容。当你第一次加载使用旧版本创建的世界时，BCLib会将其更新为最新版本以供游玩。虽然BCLib会自动为你<strong>创建备份</strong>，但你也可以手动备份。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述:</strong></span></p><p>有了BetterNether，你在下界的冒险将更加刺激。这个模组为下界添加了新的生物群系、植物和材料。其中包括新的挑战性怪物，如纳迦，或被下界生物占领的黑暗地牢。你的新工具将带来独特的改进，帮助你生存。还有许多独特的新方块供建筑师使用，以及熟悉的原版方块的变种。</p><p>在开发此模组时，特别注意了与其他下界模组和数据包的兼容性。如果你遇到任何兼容性问题或其他错误，请在我们的<a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterNether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>问题追踪器</strong></a>中告诉我们。</p><p>如果你有任何问题或需要帮助，欢迎加入我们的<a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://discord.gg/kYuATbYbKW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord服务器</strong></a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>功能:</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>数十种新的下界植物</li>\n<li>新的下界生物</li>\n<li>独特的新生物群系</li>\n<li>垂直和立体的生物群系系统（支持其他模组和数据包）</li>\n<li>许多新的材料、配方、食物、工具和物品</li>\n<li>通过植物农场和怪物农场获取某些材料的能力</li>\n<li>许多下界结构，包括大型和稀有的下界城市</li>\n<li>能够配置方块、物品、结构、生物群系和植物密度的存在（并使用ModsMenu模组进行配置GUI）</li>\n<li>与其他一些模组的集成。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>截图:</strong></strong></span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-5.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29f2/HlDEek3VNtg.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-71.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29a2/GBu5Pq3vBuc.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-49.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29ca/RDxe__idfTw.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-21.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29ac/M8PjUxu0iDE.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-14.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b2984/etYi_Q48AjM.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-68.userapi.com/1Evu3p7PqDJ_UFNPPT_6HEHMyFlzrgSDEBhYkg/_hkdd3HTVIc.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>评论:</strong></strong></span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MyltKyo_SUI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IJt8EmoNrKY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>集成:</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/281/367/64/64/637285257027983134.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/techreborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/169/440/64/64/636715176146379845.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-hammers\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/204/89/64/64/636937310898607354.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-map\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/250/279/64/64/637177927608665881.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/201/118/64/64/636918075602092560.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-pieces\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/204/17/64/64/636936880683439758.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/canvas-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/197/845/64/64/636895665884150904.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-excavators\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/225/840/64/64/637041832014507122.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>我们的其他模组:</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/471/575/64/64/637760294980874674.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/396/271/64/64/637595638220205053.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infgen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/271/438/64/64/637248195374592724.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/265/428/64/64/637229325539187031.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eden-ring\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/528/386/64/64/637851066965542722.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wunderreich\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/521/221/64/64/637840028913935424.jpeg\"></a></p>",
